# Key material must never reach a commit. provision-key.mjs already refuses to
# WRITE a park key anywhere under the repository root — this is the second line
# of defence, for a key copied in by hand or dropped here by a shell redirect.
#
# If one of these patterns ever matches something you actually want committed,
# the answer is to rename that file, not to loosen the pattern.
*.key
*.psk
*.pem
park-key*
*-park.key

# esptool / nvs_partition_gen scratch. A generated NVS image contains the PSK in
# the clear; provision-key.mjs builds them in a 0700 temp directory and shreds
# them, but a hand-run of the IDF tool will not.
*-nvs.bin
nvs-before.bin
nvs-after.bin
psk.csv

# Arduino build output.
build/
*.elf
*.bin.map

# SD card masters. The manifests are tracked; the audio is not — ~280 recordings
# do not belong in git, the same call the project already made for the station
# photo masters.
sdcard/
audio-masters/
*.mp3
*.wav
